{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15206410","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15206410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520641001:0":{"text":"You've been wandering around Halian territory with a Wildborn in tow. Are you trying to spy on us?","source_cn":"你带着一个兽人在呼临地界闲逛这么久，难道是想刺探呼临的军情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF673BCC4F10B2D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520641002:0":{"text":"I'm warning you, don't go digging where you shouldn't. Otherwise, I will show you our way of dealing with unwelcome guests, even if Perseus brought you here!","source_cn":"我警告你，别想着打探那些你们不该知道的东西。否则，就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB23294E1D49B629D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520641003:0":{"text":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"你不该对<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26D4A6AD330A7E72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"181457","variant_female_record_index":"181458","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1520641003":{"text":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"你不该对<style=stress><player_name></style>大人如此无礼。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26D4A6AD330A7E72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"You shouldn't disrespect Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"181457","variant_female_record_index":"181458","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520641004:1":{"text":"Lygos takes the letter from you, skeptical. As he reads its contents, his expression grows grim.","source_cn":"隆尔半信半疑地接下了你递去的信。当他看清信上的内容，脸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F95108B8DAC52A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520641005:1":{"text":"Meanwhile, prompted by Merlin, Gala recounts the story of Matthew...","source_cn":"与此同时，加拉也在初代梅林的询问下讲述了马修的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C07E4A9BDC24F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520641006:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog97>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0B3F27D699BAED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520641007:0":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> wants to know how you will deal with Matthew.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8F9432812D00FBBB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> wants to know how you will deal with Matthew.","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> wants to know how you will deal with Matthew.","variant_male_record_index":"181462","variant_female_record_index":"181463","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520641008:0":{"text":"This is our own business. I have no obligation to tell you anything!","source_cn":"这是呼临城的内政，我没义务告诉你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF831B4DAE416DEBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520641009:1":{"text":"Lieutenant Lygos, the Arcane Council has no intention of interfering in Halia's internal affairs.\nBut Matthew is, after all, the last remaining family member of a fallen soldier.","source_cn":"隆尔副将，魔法师协会没有想要插手呼临城内政的意思。\\n...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABDAFF6FC70A9067","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520641010:0":{"text":"In my opinion, it would be best to let General Perseus handle his punishment, to better satisfy the public.","source_cn":"以我之见，此事最好交由珀尔修斯统帅解决，才可服众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05EDA6F8AF4DF73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1520641011:0":{"text":"Hmph, leave it to Perseus? With that soft heart of his, this will definitely end up...","source_cn":"哼，交给珀尔修斯？以他那个滥好人的性格，这件事肯定会——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9593AE54BD4866BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1520641012:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog98>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04C315806986E0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1520641012":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04C315806986E0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1520641013:0":{"text":"Ahem... Perseus is the General. This is his responsibility.","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯是统帅，这件事本就该由他处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9218FCC3166C6D95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1520641014:0":{"text":"I'll let him know about this matter. But if you ask any more questions, I'll personally throw you all out of Halia!","source_cn":"我会转告他。你们要是再追问，我就把你们赶出呼临城！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3451173D09B5C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1520641015:1":{"text":"Ha... I'd like to see you try.","source_cn":"啧啧……你最好是有那个胆量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A3E89EEDBF150E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1520641016:0":{"text":"You'll be the first to go when that happens!","source_cn":"——你是第一个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA16C78AC6F1277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1520641017:0":{"text":"Calm yourself, Lieutenant Lygos. The safety of Halia rests upon you and General Perseus.","source_cn":"请别动怒，隆尔副将。呼临城的安危还要仰仗你和珀尔修斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x517220FB2FEB61C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1520641018:0":{"text":"We have faith that you'll handle this matter with a delicate touch, and in return, you can have faith in the Arcane Council's goodwill towards Halia.","source_cn":"魔法师协会相信你会秉公处理。请你也相信魔法师协会对呼临...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ADE2A14DADC3E26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"Definitely what?","source_cn":"肯定会什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x71C0E0D1F2DC0B33","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Definitely what?","female":"Definitely what?","variant_male_record_index":"77352","variant_female_record_index":"77353","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"Spit it out or I'm reporting this to Abundius.","source_cn":"快说完啊，我还等着转